  "reviewedCriticalDistinctions": [
    "C# async Task method invocation begins work; Python coroutine invocation normally does not.",
    "An already-completed await need not yield.",
    "A Task does not guarantee a thread.",
    "Nullable annotations and ! do not validate runtime input.",
    "Ordinary primary-constructor class parameters are not synthesized properties.",
    "readonly, IReadOnlyList and record with copies do not deeply freeze nested data.",
    "Record equality uses each member type equality, so List members use reference equality.",
    "Many LINQ sequences are deferred; a typical enumerable query can be re-enumerated, unlike one stored Python generator object.",
    "Integer division truncates in C#; a cast after division cannot restore the discarded fraction.",
    "Attributes attach metadata; registration and libraries decide what runs.",
    "Dependency injection need not involve a container.",
    "Model streaming and browser streaming are separate layers.",
    "Offline fake tests do not prove live service connectivity or telemetry export."
  ],
